hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"727","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Ramazan ke aakhri ashre mein i'tikaf farmate."
"728","[AI-translation] Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Ramazan ke aakhri ashre mein i'tikaf farmate yahan tak ke Allah ne Aap ko wafat di. Phir Aap ke baad Aap ki biwiyon ne i'tikaf kiya."
"729","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Ramazan ke aakhri ashre mein i'tikaf farmate. To main Aap ke liye khaima lagati. Phir Aap Fajr parhte phir us mein dakhil hote. Phir Hafsa ne Aisha se ijazat mangi ke wo khaima lagayein. To unhon ne unhe ijazat de di aur unhon ne khaima lagaya. Phir jab Zainab bint Jahsh ne use dekha to unhon ne ek aur khaima lagaya. Phir jab Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne subah khaime dekhe to farmaya: Ye kya hai? To Aap ko khabar di gayi. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum un se neki samajhte ho? Phir Aap ne us mahine i'tikaf tark kar diya. Phir Shawwal mein dus din i'tikaf farmaya."
"730","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab ashra dakhil hota to apna tehband kas lete, apni raat zinda rakhte aur apne ghar walon ko jagate."
